      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write the blurb for the city newsletter? we gotta tell everyone about the council vote on the new congestion pricing zone next week. \n\nhere are the facts:\n- vote is Tuesday at 7pm\n- zone covers the downtown core\n- goal is to reduce traffic and emissions\n- some local businesses are worried about costs/customers\n- will be a public comment period before the vote\n\ncan u make it sound professional but also kinda engaging so people actually read it? thanks",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
