      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Get ready for a big vote next **Tuesday at 7 PM** regarding the new **downtown core** congestion pricing zone. This initiative aims to significantly **reduce both traffic and local emissions** for a better city for all of us. We strongly encourage you to attend the **public comment period** before the vote to voice your opinion, especially for those concerned about the impact on local **businesses and customers**",
