    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. actually, since i'm the one sending this out, i want to make sure we land on the right note. the mayor's office is leaning pretty hard into the \"green city\" angle and thinks we should frame this as a necessary step for our environmental goals. do u think we should lead with the environmental benefits to make it sound more like progress?",
